# The new-tab page over a theme's pictures: the theme names a folder
# beside itself, the page opens on the folder's first picture with the
# words over a scrim, the next picture fades in after the theme's interval
# (a second's crossfade in twenty-five steps of forty milliseconds, each a
# timer of its own, so the clock advances in those steps), and the next new
# tab opens on the next picture in turn. The pictures are two flat colors
# scaled to cover the page, so the goldens are the fields they paint.
resize 800 500
key ctrl+t
assert-tabs 2
assert-text 09:41
assert-golden goldens/newtab-picture-one.png
advance 5000
advance 40 25
assert-golden goldens/newtab-picture-two.png
key ctrl+t
assert-tabs 3
assert-golden goldens/newtab-picture-next-tab.png
